64 67 INT_P COL_NAME_KEYWORD
67 68 ASCII_44 NO_KEYWORD
69 70 IDENT NO_KEYWORD
71 74 INT_P COL_NAME_KEYWORD
74 75 ASCII_44 NO_KEYWORD
76 77 IDENT NO_KEYWORD
78 81 INT_P COL_NAME_KEYWORD
81 82 ASCII_41 NO_KEYWORD
83 91 LANGUAGE UNRESERVED_KEYWORD
92 95 SQL_P UNRESERVED_KEYWORD
96 98 AS RESERVED_KEYWORD
99 231 SCONST NO_KEYWORD
